{"code":"BL26","wikidata":"Q4923372","wikipedia":{"en":"Lat Phrao MRT station","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว"},"summary":{"en":"Lat Phrao station is the name of two Bangkok MRT stations, on the Blue Line and Yellow Line, located at the intersection of Ratchadaphisek Road and Lat Phrao Road. It is the northern terminus of the Yellow Line. Although the station's name is Lat Phrao, it is located in Chatuchak district, not Lat Phrao district and Central Ladprao is nearer to Phahon Yothin station.","th":"สถานีลาดพร้าว เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าที่ตั้งอยู่บริเวณทางแยกรัชดา–ลาดพร้าว (จุดตัดระหว่างถนนรัชดาภิเษกกับถนนลาดพร้าว) ในพื้นที่เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นจุดเชื่อมต่อสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทาง"},"opened":"2004-07-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Lat_Phrao_Station_-_platform_level_%282%29.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_Station_-_platform_level_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_Station_-_platform_level_(2).jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Entrance_to_Lat_Phrao_Station_at_Park%26Ride_Building.jpg/960px-Entrance_to_Lat_Phrao_Station_at_Park%26Ride_Building.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Entrance_to_Lat_Phrao_Station_at_Park%26Ride_Building.jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Lat_Phrao_Station_-_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg/960px-Lat_Phrao_Station_-_concourse_level_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lat_Phrao_Station_-_concourse_level_(1).jpg","author":"NC-MyLifeArm","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Lat_Phrao_Station